  "airline": "SWA",
  "name": "Liberty One (US flag)",
  "kind": "special",
  "from": "2026-04",
  "description": "Fuselage: Navy blue forward fuselage and nose with large white stars back to the wing; red and white wavy stripes on the aft fuselage to the tail. Cheatlines: Flag stripes. Tail: from June 2026 Independence One's fin (navy, a white band and a red band along the leading edge and tip on the Heart's lines) with white 'Southwest'; the Heart fin before. Engines: navy at the front; aft of a diagonal edge, red, white and red flag stripes over the cowling. Winglets: Navy split-scimitar with America250 logo. Titles: 'Southwest' white on lower fin; 'America 250' logo on the nose. Artwork: US flag. Colors hex: approximate.",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "drawnOn": "B38M",
